  "details": "(Details of cause still underreview, will updated.)\nIf your avatar has Avatar 3D Audio with VRCSpatialAudioSource,\nit seems to be get broken in certain situations.\nIssue effects be same like when VRCSpatialAudioSource got removed on runtime or disabled.\n\nAs of current,\nI more like to see issue if\n*World has some audio source with VRCSpatialAudioSource component GameObject.\n*May has some object like that to make it happen.\n*Not yet confirmed count is accounted world object only or even other avatars.\n*This issue continued past few month.\n\n\n-Temporary Solution-\nTry switch to other avatar for 10 minutes around and put back to original to sort out issue may help but you may need to move to other worlds.\n(Avatar Cache seems cleared by then, forgot to try out do this on same world...)",
